; atc_pause.ngc - Operator notification hook for manual tool change
;
; Called after the outgoing carousel tool has been returned (if applicable)
; and before the operator pause.  The ATC plugin has already reported the
; incoming tool name/comment to the stream if one exists in the tool table.
;
; Parameters set by plugin before this macro runs:
;   #4900 = incoming tool number
;   #4902 = outgoing carousel pocket (0 if outgoing tool was not in carousel)
;
; Geometry parameters — set once by G65 P200 in your startup macro:
;   #4920-#4922  Position 1: Safe XYZ  (used for Z clearance before XY move)

; ── Move to manual change position (G30) ─────────────────────────────────────
; G30 (second home position) is used as the manual tool change position.
; Set it once via G10 L2 P30 or the grblHAL coordinate system settings.
G53 G0 Z#4922
G30

; ── Notify operator ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; Add any additional signalling here (lights, buzzers, etc.)
(MSG, Load tool #4900 and press cycle start)

M2
